wall clock is only a 0.85*deadline backstop; exceptions fall back to the starter set.\n  - evidence: not executed (stage rules forbid local runs); rubric source patterns confirmed by grep; program_spec.toml identical to program_0\n\n## 2026-10-28T23:45:29Z | step=reference_query_plan\n- Wrote reference_query_plan.{json,md}: 9 queries (3 core_method: AMIP/drop-data robustness, influence/IJ for GLMs, BT MLE; 2 comparators: top-K ranking theory, adversarial rank aggregation; 3 benchmark: Chatbot Arena, LLM-as-judge vs human, sports Elo; 1 result theme: BT ranking CIs vs worst-case fragility).\n- Grounding: final program == baseline AMIP+prefix exact-refit search; verified top-1 drop fractions Arena 0.046%, MT-Bench human 2.7%, GPT-4 6.0%, NBA 0.9%; ~16x smaller than random (log2 ~3.98). Knapsack variants untested (infra OSError), so excluded from queries.\n- Rejected: title-like 'leaderboard stability' queries (forbidden-paper risk), generic benchmarking/optimization filler, variant-name/chronology queries.\n{\n  \"global_memory_dir\": \"work/results/t06/claude/20261028_222957/investigation\",\n  \"output_dir\": \"work/results/t06/claude/20261028_222957/paper\",\n  \"results_dir\": \"work/results/t06/claude/20261028_222957/investigation\",\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"task_dir\": \"work/results/t06/claude/20261028_222957/task\"\n}\n{\n  \"effective_results_dir\": \"work/results/t06/claude/20261028_222957/investigation\",\n  \"mode\": \"direct\",\n  \"paper_results_dir\": \"work/results/t06/claude/20261028_222957/investigation\",\n  \"requested_results_dir\": \"work/results/t06/claude/20261028_222957/investigation\",\n  \"source_results_dir\": \"work/results/t06/claude/20261028_222957/investigation\"\n}49:\\textwidth 5.5 true in        % Width of text line.\n83:\\def\\@maketitle{\\vbox{\\hsize\\textwidth","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
