c source patterns confirmed by grep; program_spec.toml identical to program_0\", \"next_action\": \"harness evaluation; inspect diagnostics search_error, verify_failures, final_size vs baseline_size, chosen_source\", \"tags\": [\"gate=pending\"]}\n{\"timestamp\": \"2026-10-28T23:45:29Z\", \"step\": \"reference_query_plan\", \"scope\": \"paper\", \"summary\": \"Reference query plan written: 9 component-literature queries (AMIP, influence/IJ, BT MLE, top-K ranking, rank-aggregation manipulation, Chatbot Arena, LLM-judge vs human, sports Elo, BT ranking CIs).\", \"evidence\": \"paper_data.json final_evaluation metrics + verified_k; program identical to baseline AMIP\", \"next_action\": \"retrieve references using reference_query_plan.json; avoid title-like queries that could surface the forbidden paper\", \"tags\": [\"reference_plan\"]}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
